  "content": "\n\n<p>此專案已停止開發，請參見&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/JustARandomGuyNo512/GCAA-gunscraft_1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">JustARandomGuyNo512/GCAA-gunscraft_1.20.1 (github.com)</a></p>\n<p>新模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guns-craft-adventurers-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guns Craft Adventurer's Arsenal - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a></p>\n<p>Gunscraft：</p>\n<p>Minecraft Forge 1.20.1 版本的槍械模組&nbsp;</p>\n<p><del>#本模組目前仍在開發中。</del></p>\n<p>本模組偏向生存遊戲模式：收集、製作與射擊。適合需要槍械支援的 PVE 場景。</p>\n<p><br>#模組內含精緻的槍械、配件模型以及出色的模型渲染優化。<br>#你可以為武器安裝各種配件，改變它們的屬性...</p>\n<h1><del>製作系統即將新增...</del></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請不要使用 OptiFine...</p>\n<p>從測試版 v0.3.5 起，我放棄了對 OptiFine 的適配...</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QpXTRjFpG4\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/fPHHpWZJHS</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QpXTRjFpG4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/QpXTRjFpG4</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>目前所有槍械：Glock19, M1911,&nbsp; Mini-uzi, Mac10, Vector .45,&nbsp; Mp5, M4a1, Akm, Hk416, AK74, Aug-a3, Famas-F1, SCAR-H, Mini-m249，M60, Mg3, M700,M82A1 Awp, M870, Beretta 686, xm1014</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/876/720/2024-05-28_14.png\"></p>\n<p>部分戰鬥截圖（實際效果）：</p>\n<p>雙持手槍：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/807/257/2024-02-12_13.png\" alt=\"double pistol\" width=\"1746\" height=\"925\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>手電筒輔助開採：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/876/719/2024-05-28_14.png\"></p>\n<p>酷炫的配件系統：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/859/597/tactical_ak.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Mg3（配備紅點瞄準鏡）：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/787/722/2024-01-10_16.png\" alt=\"mgs shoot\" width=\"1897\" height=\"1005\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>戰術型 M4A1：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/807/258/2024-02-13_19.png\" alt=\"tactical m4a1\" width=\"1746\" height=\"925\"></p>\n<p>遊俠戰士：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/807/259/2024-02-13_15.png\" alt=\"aaa\" width=\"1746\" height=\"925\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>不同類型的槍械具有不同的射擊機制：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/238/2024-02-22_10.png\" alt=\"awp bolt action\" width=\"1897\" height=\"1005\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;成為狙擊手！：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/789/236/sniper_rifle.png\" alt=\"be a sniper!\" width=\"1746\" height=\"925\"></p>\n<p>瞄準鏡射擊：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/137/2024-05-09_18.png\"></p>\n<p>你可以為你的槍械安裝配件：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/859/596/2024-05-04_22.png\"></p>\n<p>配件可以改變武器的外觀與屬性&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/809/118/2024-02-17_01.png\" alt=\"hk416\" width=\"1897\" height=\"1005\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/136/2024-05-09_18.png\"></p>\n<p>（建議使用 Oculus 載入光影）...</p>",
